  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>m</mi></math> is chosen in the quadratic equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> such that the sum of its roots is greatest, then the absolute difference of the cubes of its roots is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
